id: CICD-020
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: CI retry masks flaky tests
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: retry
patterns:
  - regex: retry:\s*[2-9]|retries:\s*[2-9]|flaky-test-retryer|re-run
    message: "Test retries mask flaky tests — fix the root cause instead of retrying"
fix: Investigate flaky tests. Common causes: shared state, timing dependencies, network calls, random ordering. Fix the flake, then remove the retry.
